    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a \"mistake\" like you're saying. it was something that actually hurt someone. it's deep in my character. i look in the mirror and i just see someone who's fundamentally broken. how can anyone tell me i have worth when i know what i'm actually capable of?",
